WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.620 line:73%
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

c02
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.740 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.080 line:73%
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

c04
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.470 line:73%
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

c05
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.920 line:73%
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

c06
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.890 line:73%
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

c07
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.200 line:73%
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

c08
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.390 line:73%
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

c09
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.570 line:73%
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

c10
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:30.880 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

c11
00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.690 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
